Output contract — return one turn:
- `speaker`: always "customer".
- `content`: exactly what you say next (1–4 spoken sentences).
- `done`: boolean (see above).
- `done_reason`: short tag when done, else null.
- `commitments`: promises you make in this turn, each `{who, what, due}` (`who` is "customer"; `due` as you said it, or null), e.g. running a test and reporting back. An empty list if you promise nothing. They are not shown in the transcript.
